    "emp": "Finary",
    "title": "Finance Author",
    "sector": "Entreprise (direction financière)",
    "famille": "Autres métiers de la finance",
    "volet": "cdi-cdd",
    "loc": "Paris",
    "zone": "Paris / Île-de-France",
    "maison": "Finary",
    "maisonReference": true,
    "place": "France",
    "url": "https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/finary/bc11ef25-b1ee-4cc6-b4f1-acc7e6fef252",
    "source": "ashby:finary",
    "_descr": "What is Finary?\n\nWe are on a mission to give power back to investors. We're building the AI-powered one-stop shop for investing, where you can track your assets, manage your budget, invest, and learn. Mounir https://www.linkedin.com/in/mounirlaggoune/ launched Finary in 2021, and we've since crossed 1,000,000 users. We ship cutting-edge products with touches of delight, and we care deeply about experience, performance, and ease of use.\n\nWhy now?\n\nA new generation of investors is emerging: ambitious and involved. Money is no longer taboo, and the pension system is under tremendous pressure. We see a world where investing empowers everybody to live the life they've always dreamt of. \n\nTo fuel that, we raised €40M and are backed by Hedosophia, Y Combinator, and Speedinvest, alongside world-class founders and operators like Steve Anavi & Alexandre Prot (Qonto), Matthieu Rouif (Photoroom), Eric Demuth (Bitpanda), Axel Weber (former UBS Chairman), and Harsh Sinha (CTO at Wise). \n\nAnd in July 2026, the AMF granted us our MiCA license, on top of our Investment Firm license: Finary is now one of the very few French platforms holding both, offering stocks, ETFs and crypto on a single regulated platform, at the exact moment Europe consolidates around licensed players. There's never been a more exciting time to join.\n\nWhat we offer\n\nWe hire people who lift the team's ceiling: A-players who are as kind as they are demanding. We move fast, aim high, and treat ownership as the default. Our culture is direct, transparent, and built on radical candor. We challenge each other openly, then commit. It's demanding and not for everyone, but if you want to raise the bar every day alongside equally driven teammates, this is the place.\n\nAnd we don't hedge on this. We believe AI fluency is the single most important skill of the next decade, and it's a real bar here, not a buzzword. Everyone at Finary has rebuilt how they work around AI. It's the first reflex, not a side experiment. If reaching for AI before you reach for the old way isn't already second nature, this won't be the right fit. If it is, you'll be surrounded by people pushing that frontier every day.\n\nRead more about our values here. https://finarywealth.notion.site/About-Finary-2f5919045b5d8060afd1d4e887ac550f?pvs=143\n\nWhat you can expect\n\n - A high-performing team: work with A-players across every discipline, in an environment that challenges you and helps you grow fast.\n\n - Ownership from day one: freedom, responsibility, and trust. We hire for talent and get out of the way.\n\n - Impact that matters: build a product that helps people take control of their financial future.\n\n - A hybrid setup: teammates across France and Europe, meeting in person in Paris six times a year.\n\n - Competitive compensation: a package aligned with your experience and impact.\n\nWhat we don't care about\n\n - Your degree or your school. We care about what you bring to the team.\n\n - Ping pong tables, free laundry, or trendy perks. We focus on what truly matters.\n\nFinary is building the private bank of the internet generation. Our YouTube channel is the #1 personal finance channel in France: 880,000 subscribers and 5 to 10 million views per month, produced entirely in-house by a team that treats content like a product: measured, iterated, engineered.\n\n\nTHE ROLE\n\nYou will own everything that needs to be written at Finary Media, end to end. Research, script, packaging, fact-checking, delivery: the words are yours from the first idea to the final cut.\n\nYour two main arenas:\n\n - The Finary YouTube channel. Long-form videos mixing storytelling, economics, and investing, watched by hundreds of thousands of people. Your benchmark: our best videos pass 1 million views.\n\n - Finary One. Content for our private wealth offer, speaking to sophisticated investors with 500K€+ portfolios. This is the highest-stakes writing at Finary: fewer views, bigger consequences.\n\nYou will also write for the formats around them: podcast preparation for Finary Talk, and whatever else needs words. If it is written and it matters, it is yours.\n\nTwo things make this role different from any scriptwriting job:\n\n - You appear on camera. You will present your own scripts. This is not optional; it is part of the craft here.\n\n - You work AI-native. Our production system runs on LLM workflows, custom skills, and automation. You will not just use these tools, you will build your own. The best person for this job has already built things: prompts, agents, knowledge bases, small scripts.\n\n\nWHAT SUCCESS LOOKS LIKE\n\n - One of your videos passes 1 million views within your first 3 months\n\n - From month 3, your Finary One content generates €100M per month in lead assets\n\n - 90% of your scripts are validated in a single review round, and your lead time trends down\n\n\nYOU WOULD BE A GREAT FIT IF YOU HAVE\n\n - Expert-level knowledge of investing and personal finance: you can go deep on PE, real estate, tax wrappers, and wealth structuring without notes\n\n - A proven writing track record in front of a real audience (YouTube, press, newsletter, blog) with results you can show\n\n - Ruthless factual discipline: no mistakes in data, numbers, or concepts, ever\n\n - Concision as a reflex, in writing and in conversation\n\n - Full autonomy: you run your own system, hit your own deadlines, and nobody needs to chase you\n\n - An AI-native practice: you build with LLMs and automation because it is how you think\n\n - Comfort on camera, or the hunger to get there fast\n\n\nBONUS POINTS\n\n - You have written for high-performing YouTube channels or run your own\n\n - Background in finance, asset management, or fintech\n\n - You have shipped a small coding project, a Claude skill, or an automation pipeline on your own\n\n\nHOW TO APPLY?\n\nTell us why you want to join Finary. Share with us what excites you about our mission and how you will contribute. Make your first impression count. \n",
