    "_descr": " About the role, We are looking for a Master’s-level intern to join our Wealth Solutions Business Development team in Paris for a 6-month internship. This internship is an opportunity to contribute to the evolution of our working methods by helping us integrate Artificial Intelligence into our daily processes, with a particular focus on investment solution proposal production and business monitoring for our Wealth Distribution clients. The successful candidate will support the team in improving the efficiency, quality, and scalability of our client-facing materials and internal workflows, while gaining exposure to investment solutions, business development, and innovation in asset management. Key responsibilities: The intern will work closely with the Wealth Solutions Business Development team on a variety of projects, including: - Mapping and analyzing current workflows used to produce investment solution proposals and related client materials - Identifying opportunities to leverage AI tools to improve productivity, consistency, and responsiveness - Supporting the design and testing of AI-enabled use cases for proposal drafting, content structuring, data synthesis, and document personalization - Helping build templates, prompts, and process frameworks to streamline proposal creation - Assisting in the preparation of investment solution presentations and proposal materials for Wealth Distribution clients - Contributing to the development of best practices for the use of AI in asset management and wealth solutions. What you will gain : - Hands-on experience in a leading asset management environment - Exposure to the Wealth Distribution business and investment solution design - The opportunity to contribute to innovation and transformation initiatives - A meaningful role in shaping how AI can support business development - Close collaboration with experienced professionals in a dynamic, international team ",
